<p style="text-align: center;"><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><br></p>
<section class="docx">
 <p class="docx_5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span id="_GoBack"></span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 导师聘任申请系统操作流程</span></p>
 <p class="docx_7" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: 0pt;">一、系统登录</span><br></p>
 <p class="docx_9" style="line-height: calc(100% + 23.4pt); text-indent: 24pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">1.打开西安电子科技大学官网（https://www.xidian.edu.cn），点击页面底部“研究生系统”，通过学校统一身份认证账号和密码登录。</span></p>
 <p style="margin-bottom: 26pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 412pt; height: 460pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="/__local/B/2B/3A/A7795E0A63BA864E18527A60486_B0D88355_80B07.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/B2B3AA7795E0A63BA864E18527A60486/B0D88355/80B07" vheight=" 460pt" vwidth=" 412pt" orisrc="/__local/3/7A/73/EE53F3BA98113F0B052F5B7CC7A_AAFC0F66_88C17.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 412pt; height: 460pt;"></span></p>
 <p class="docx_6" style="margin-bottom: 12.15pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">二、功能选择</span></p>
 <p class="docx_6" style="text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12.15pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: FangSong_GB2312; white-space: pre-wrap;">（1）</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: FangSong_GB2312; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;">点击右上角用户角色切换按钮，切换至“导师组”角色；</span></span></p>
 <p class="docx_6" style="text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12.15pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: FangSong_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">（2）在左侧菜单栏，点击“导师管理”--&gt;“导师聘任”--&gt;“导师聘任申请”； </span></p>
 <p class="docx_6" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 12.15pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="text-indent: 0pt; font-family: FangSong_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">（3）点击蓝色“新增”按钮，进入申请数据填报页面。</span></p>
 <p style="margin-bottom: 45pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 417pt; height: 218pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="/__local/F/7E/4E/7CA9CFE0A0F90D1494C50D75741_263DF258_27D26.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F7E4E7CA9CFE0A0F90D1494C50D75741/263DF258/27D26" vheight=" 218pt" vwidth=" 417pt" orisrc="/__local/3/74/52/FB356F396D9CDAA407C2436FE7D_0DEB8653_2DDFC.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 417pt; height: 218pt;"></span></p>
 <p class="docx_7" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">三、数据填报</span></p>
 <p class="docx_11" style="text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">1.申请信息填报</span></p>
 <p class="docx_11" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;"><span style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: FangSong_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">（1）在“资格认定身份聘任”下方列出了导师目前所具有的全部导师身份，分别点击各个身份对应的“申请”“不申请”按钮，对每个身份进行是否申请正常聘任选择；</span></p>
 <p class="docx_11" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;"><span style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: FangSong_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">（2）在“跨异地研究院聘任”下方点击蓝色“新增”按钮，可申请跨异地研究院聘任。“跨异地研究院聘任”面向非广州研究院/杭州研究院导师（即面向校本部学院导师），当符合所在学院、广州研究院/杭州研究院等学院跨异地研究院聘任要求，经相关学院同意后，可申请“跨异地研究院聘任”，后续流程会由相关学院管理人员进行审核，审核通过后所申请异地研究院可作为导师的非招生主学院进行聘任。申请“跨异地研究院聘任”时，所选择的导师身份须是导师在本部学院已具有的导师身份，否则无法正常提交保存至下一步。申请“跨异地研究院聘任”时，导师人事关系在校内就选择专职身份（不论人事关系是否在异地研究院），导师人事关系在校外就选择兼职身份，否则无法正常提交保存至下一步。</span></p>
 <p class="docx_11" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;"><span style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: FangSong_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">（3）点击“保存并下一步”。注：导师聘任申请均须处于申请时间范围内才可进行申请，超时或未到时间，“资格认定身份聘任”申请无法选取，“跨异地研究院聘任”新增后无法提交保存至下一步。</span></p>
 <p style="margin-bottom: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 417pt; height: 221pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="/__local/6/B2/76/225DAFB48F9B46D6A85E2CB356F_AAE320AA_33D57.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/6B276225DAFB48F9B46D6A85E2CB356F/AAE320AA/33D57" vheight=" 221pt" vwidth=" 417pt" orisrc="/__local/6/F3/95/1FF2158151549417D2C9A003FFE_AB804EE9_3C379.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 417pt; height: 221pt;"></span></p>
 <p class="docx_5" style="line-height: calc(100% + 23.4pt); text-indent: 24pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">注：兼职导师务必如实填报“是否签订聘用合同”“聘任开始年月”“聘任截止年月”“聘任年限”等。</span></p>
 <p style="text-indent: 2em;"><br></p>
 <section class="docx">
  <span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">2.基本信息填报</span> 
 </section>
 <p><br></p>
 <p><br></p>
 <p style="line-height: 3em;"><br></p>
 <section class="docx">
  <span style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: FangSong_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; （1）填报个人基本信息，其中部分数据（如“职工号”“姓名”等）直接取自人事系统数据，导师用户端暂不能修改；&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> 
 </section>
 <section class="docx">
  <span style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: FangSong_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; （2）补充完基本信息后，点击“保存”以保存当前数据，点击“下一步”进入下一环节。</span> 
 </section>
 <p><br></p>
 <p><br></p>
</section>
<section class="docx">
 <p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 431pt; height: 233pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="/__local/6/4D/F6/D9792EE79E823A74FA6D1DA0E79_CBA1578B_2C5ED.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/64DF6D9792EE79E823A74FA6D1DA0E79/CBA1578B/2C5ED" vheight=" 233pt" vwidth=" 431pt" orisrc="/__local/9/85/3B/689005E3DF8734904308ED38875_28D949E3_3544D.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 431pt; height: 233pt;"></span></p>
 <p class="docx_11" style="text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; text-indent: 24pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">3.申请数据填报</span></p>
 <p class="docx_11" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">（1）点击左侧“教学信息”“科研信息”下的二级菜单，进行开课、论文、专利、项目等情况填报；</span></p>
 <p class="docx_11" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">（2）点击蓝色“新增”按钮，进行对应业绩新增填报录入（若未出现蓝色“新增”按钮及相应填报框，请进行浏览器页面缩放，页面调至合适大小蓝色“新增”按钮及相应填报框会自动出现）；</span></p>
 <p class="docx_11" style="text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">（3）点击“下一步”保存并进入下一环节。</span></p>
 <p class="docx_10" style="line-height: calc(100% + 23.4pt); text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">注：申请数据应严格按照导师选聘相关要求如实填报；“导师近三年科研项目情况”中项目的“实际到校经费（万元）”“本人可支配到校经费（万元）”均指近三年到校经费。</span></p>
 <p style="margin-bottom: 35pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 418pt; height: 219pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="/__local/C/FA/2A/FC9C573CCC56472DB8F0A94EDB0_166ADC41_29B58.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/CFA2AFC9C573CCC56472DB8F0A94EDB0/166ADC41/29B58" vheight=" 219pt" vwidth=" 418pt" orisrc="/__local/C/FD/E7/213332F0AA24B4E5CD098393BB7_1FD5CF6B_3147F.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 418pt; height: 219pt;"></span></p>
 <p class="docx_12" style="margin-left: 24pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">4.主观陈述填报</span></p>
 <p style="text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">（1）填报主观陈述内容，完成后点击“保存并下一步”进入下一环节。</span></p>
 <p class="docx_8" style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">注：避免将特殊字符复制于填报框内，否则可能引起字符显示异常或无法保存并下一步情况；建议将填报文字先复制于Windows自带的记事本软件中，然后从记事本软件复制于填报框中。</span></p>
 <p style="margin-bottom: 22pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 414pt; height: 232pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="/__local/B/73/F0/43190F59DB100ADE56A9EC77615_ACD08DC3_1DCB6.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/B73F043190F59DB100ADE56A9EC77615/ACD08DC3/1DCB6" vheight=" 232pt" vwidth=" 414pt" orisrc="/__local/F/9B/40/400194B28D8A204DB16289C644B_C2EB1CDF_239FC.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 414pt; height: 232pt;"></span></p>
 <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 3em;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">5.确认并提交</span></p>
 <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 3em;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">（1）阅读承诺内容，勾选承诺框；</span></p>
 <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 3em;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">（2）点击“提交申请”，正式提交导师聘任申请。</span></p>
 <p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p>
 <p style="margin-bottom: 42pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 408pt; height: 213pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="/__local/9/8B/E5/ADF0A45713681EE51CECE2F4CA9_3E5EFD60_1E0D5.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/98BE5ADF0A45713681EE51CECE2F4CA9/3E5EFD60/1E0D5" vheight=" 213pt" vwidth=" 408pt" orisrc="/__local/3/B6/BB/5A2EC7D6C119831DE95432AA9FA_28506070_229AE.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 408pt; height: 213pt;"></span></p>
 <p class="docx_7" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">四、流程审核</span></p>
 <p class="docx_8" style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">1.在左侧菜单栏，点击“导师管理”--&gt;“导师聘任”--&gt;“导师聘任申请”可查看导师聘任申请记录，查看审核节点和审核状态；</span></p>
 <p style="line-height: calc(100% + 23.4pt); margin-left: 24pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: FangSong_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2.点击“查看”“打印”“撤回”，可查看或下载打印简况表、撤回并修改、</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: FangSong_GB2312; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 0pt;">或撤回并删除申请数据；若院系已审核，“撤回”按钮将消失无法点击。</span></span></p>
 <p style="text-align:center"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 413pt; height: 213pt; font-family: FangSong_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="/__local/D/09/51/9021200E84606496C5B82283570_C081AED2_2DCF6.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/D09519021200E84606496C5B82283570/C081AED2/2DCF6" vheight=" 213pt" vwidth=" 413pt" orisrc="/__local/F/B6/D0/D9D5D252108D90F438DD2857121_CB8A6141_35746.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 413pt; height: 213pt;"></span></p>
</section>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
</div></p>
